   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNICEF Basic Education 10-13</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">UNICEF Basic Education 10-13</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Tematiskt st&#xF6;d till UNICEF:s utbildningsprogram i Afghanistan. Syftet &#xE4;r att bidra till &#xF6;kad andel flickor inskrivna i grundskolan,         fortsatt skolg&#xE5;ng f&#xF6;r flickor till h&#xF6;gre &#xE5;rskurser och &#xF6;kad           l&#xE4;skunnighet hos kvinnor i &#xE5;ldrarna 15-49 &#xE5;r. Detta kommer att ske    genom st&#xF6;d till sektorreform, genom byskolor och gemom att &#xF6;ka        kvaliteten i grundskolan med s&#xE4;rskilt fokus p&#xE5; flickor och kvinnor.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Thematic support &quot;Basic Education &amp; Gender Equality&quot;.The aim is to    contribute to increase primary school enrolment and retention for     girls &amp; increase literacy rates of females in the ages 15-49 years.   This will be done through support to sector reform and community      based schools, increase the quality of primary education with special focus on girls, and increase women&apos;s literacy and empowerment.</narrative>
  </description>
